        "statement": "When a loan with an unknown notice is returned, that unknown notice is dropped. It no longer appears in unknown-notices, and confirm-notice for that copy reports \u0027no unknown notice\u0027. No further notice can be sent for the ended loan, so nothing needs reconciling.",
