        "statement": "A loan counts as \u0027past its due date today\u0027 using the existing LEND-L02 overdue rule, Loans.overdue (days late \u003E 0, so the day after the due date). A loan needs a notice unless its stored notice is for its current due date (Notices.needsNotice).",
